{
  "name": "iFood Sales to Google Sheets Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "c4a3f8e9-2b1d-4f5c-8a7b-9d6e3c2f1a8b",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        220,
        680
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔐 Autenticação iFood\n\n**Configure as credenciais OAuth2 para iFood:**\n- Client ID\n- Client Secret\n- Authorization URL\n- Access Token URL\n- Scope necessário para leitura de pedidos\n\n⚠️ **Importante:** Configure o refresh token para renovação automática",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "n1a2b3c4-5d6e-7f8g-9h0i-1j2k3l4m5n6o",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://merchant-api.ifood.com.br/order/v1.0/orders",
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "createdAt",
              "value": "={{ $now.minus(7, 'days').toISO() }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "size",
              "value": "100"
            },
            {
              "name": "page",
              "value": "0"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "d5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4g-5h6i7j8k9l0m",
      "name": "Get iFood Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        680
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 Estrutura de Dados iFood\n\n**Campos esperados da API:**\n- `id`: ID do pedido\n- `customer.name`: Nome do cliente\n- `items[]`: Array de produtos\n  - `name`: Nome do produto\n  - `quantity`: Quantidade\n  - `unitPrice`: Preço unitário\n- `total.orderAmount`: Valor total\n- `createdAt`: Data/hora\n- `status`: Status do pedido",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "o7p8q9r0-1s2t-3u4v-5w6x-7y8z9a0b1c2d",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e3f4g5h6-7i8j-9k0l-1m2n-3o4p5q6r7s8t",
      "name": "Split Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        660,
        405
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Vendas iFood"
        },
        "sheetName": "Sheet1",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "ID Pedido": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "Data/Hora": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($json.createdAt).toFormat('dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm:ss') }}",
            "Cliente": "={{ $json.customer.name }}",
            "Produto": "={{ $json.items.map(item => item.name).join(', ') }}",
            "Qtd": "={{ $json.items.map(item => item.quantity).reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) }}",
            "Preço Unitário": "={{ $json.items.map(item => 'R$ ' + item.unitPrice.toFixed(2)).join(', ') }}",
            "Valor Total": "={{ 'R$ ' + $json.total.orderAmount.toFixed(2) }}",
            "Status": "={{ $json.status }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "USER_ENTERED"
        }
      },
      "id": "u9v0w1x2-3y4z-5a6b-7c8d-9e0f1g2h3i4j",
      "name": "Check Existing Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        1015
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "[REMOVED]",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Validação de Duplicados\n\n**Antes de gravar:**\n1. Busca todos os IDs existentes na planilha\n2. Compara com o ID do pedido atual\n3. Ignora se já existir\n4. Adiciona se for novo\n\n💡 **Dica:** Considere criar uma coluna auxiliar com hash único",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "k5l6m7n8-9o0p-1q2r-3s4t-5u6v7w8x9y0z",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        780
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Vendas iFood"
        },
        "sheetName": "Sheet1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7g8h-9i0j-1k2l3m4n5o6p",
      "name": "Read Existing Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        180
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "[REMOVED]",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": ""
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Read Existing Orders').all().map(row => row.json['ID Pedido']) }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "array",
                "operation": "notContains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "q7r8s9t0-1u2v-3w4x-5y6z-7a8b9c0d1e2f",
      "name": "Filter New Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Vendas iFood"
        },
        "sheetName": "Sheet1",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "ID Pedido": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "Data/Hora": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($json.createdAt).toFormat('dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm:ss') }}",
            "Cliente": "={{ $json.customer.name }}",
            "Produto": "={{ $json.items.map(item => item.name).join(', ') }}",
            "Qtd": "={{ $json.items.map(item => item.quantity).reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) }}",
            "Preço Unitário": "={{ $json.items.map(item => 'R$ ' + item.unitPrice.toFixed(2)).join(', ') }}",
            "Valor Total": "={{ 'R$ ' + $json.total.orderAmount.toFixed(2) }}",
            "Status": "={{ $json.status }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "USER_ENTERED"
        }
      },
      "id": "g3h4i5j6-7k8l-9m0n-1o2p-3q4r5s6t7u8v",
      "name": "Append to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        330
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "[REMOVED]",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚨 Tratamento de Erros\n\n**Configurar nó de erro para:**\n- Capturar erros de autenticação\n- Detectar limite de API excedido\n- Aguardar 60 segundos\n- Retentar automaticamente\n\n**Logs importantes:**\n- Total de pedidos processados\n- Pedidos ignorados (duplicados)\n- Erros encontrados",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "w9x0y1z2-3a4b-5c6d-7e8f-9g0h1i2j3k4l",
